.PP
Of course \f[B]export\f[R] works with any list of addresses from stdin,
for instance the result of \f[B]extract\f[R] operations on search
queries, so that multiple commands can be concatenated.
.SS Addressbook in brief
.PP
Here a roundup on the addressbook commands that are available from the
